Subject: [PATCH 6.18.y 1/5] ipv6: pass proto by value to ipv6_push_nfrag_opts() and ipv6_push_frag_opts()
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:20:59 -0400
Message-ID: <20260901002103.2024757-1-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0
In-Reply-To: <2026083112-scrunch-gazing-cb7a@gregkh>
References: <2026083112-scrunch-gazing-cb7a@gregkh>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: stable@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <stable.vger.kernel.org>
List-Subscribe: <mailto:stable+subscribe@vger.kernel.org>
List-Unsubscribe: <mailto:stable+unsubscribe@vger.kernel.org>
